.SS "Analysis: Correlation"
Correlation Matrix in the Analysis sidebar.
.PP
\fIExplore\fR
.TP
\fBTab\fR
Between the matrix and the sidebar
.TP
\fB\(ua / \(da (j/k)\fR
Matrix rows, or the sidebar's tools
.TP
\fB\(<- / \(-> (h/l)\fR
Matrix columns
.TP
\fBHome / End\fR
Jump to the first/last corner cell (the column resets too)
